      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original Governors Village Shopping Center opened in 2000 with a grocery store, later adding a dry cleaner, nail salon, and food take‑out shops.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governors_Village%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2005 a second shopping center opened in Governors Village, offering restaurants, a veterinarian, and a dentist’s office.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governors_Village%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Commons @ Governors Village opened in 2012, housing a realty firm, independent pharmacy, construction firm, and an insurance office in 2016.",
